 ## Background
-This architecture is based on the NeuS framework, which introduced the separation of geometry and material decoding using a feature vector [S1]. It has been extended in subsequent works such as ShadowNeuS, which incorporates shadow ray supervision, and Ray-Distance Volume Rendering, which introduces the SRDF branch to address SDF limitations [S1, S2].
